  "description": "An uncrewed lander on Pathfinder Heavy's stages: a probe core with a high-gain dish, a survey camera and a sample kit on a small engine stage, under a parachute, over a heat shield. Far from home its commands take minutes to arrive: fly it with the flight computer (C). Stages: 0-2 as Pathfinder Heavy, 3 lander separation, 4 parachute, 5 heat shield off and the lander engine lit. Power: a battery and two solar wings on the lander stage (U unfolds them; fold them before coming into air).",
